---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About TechOnPlay — tech, simplified. Practical reviews, guides and explainers on AI, gaming and security.">
  <section class="container about">
    <h1>About TechOnPlay</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p><strong>Tech, Simplified.</strong></p>
      <p>
        Let's face it: keeping up with technology can be overwhelming. New
        gadgets drop every week, and AI seems to change everything overnight.
        That's where <strong>TechOnPlay</strong> comes in. We are your go-to
        source for making sense of the digital world without the headache.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p><strong>We believe technology should solve problems, not create them.</strong></p>
      <p>
        You shouldn't need a manual to understand the latest trends. Our goal
        is to cut through the jargon and hype to bring you practical,
        down-to-earth advice. Whether you're looking to upgrade your
        smartphone or just want to know what ChatGPT can actually do for you,
        we've got you covered.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Bring to the Table</h2>
      <p>We create content for real people, focusing on:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Buying Advice:</strong> unbiased reviews that tell you if that new gadget is actually worth your hard-earned money.</li>
        <li><strong>How-To Guides:</strong> step-by-step tutorials to help you master your devices and apps in minutes.</li>
        <li><strong>Tech Explained:</strong> we break down complex topics, like AI and cybersecurity, into plain English.</li>
        <li><strong>Daily News:</strong> the most important updates from the tech world, filtered for what truly matters to you.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Trust Us?</h2>
      <p>
        Because we are users first. We test products in the real world, on
        commutes, in home offices and living rooms, to see how they hold up.
        We ask the questions that matter: <em>Does the battery actually last
        all day? Is this upgrade really necessary?</em>
      </p>

      <h2>Let's Connect</h2>
      <p>
        Technology is more fun when we explore it together. Join our
        community, sign up for our newsletter, or reach out through our
        <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
      <p><strong>TechOnPlay – Play with the Future.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: 56px 80px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .about h1 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
</style>
